---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal notice"
  description="Legal notice and terms of use for the content and tools published on Josué's website."
>
  <section class="wrap max-w-2xl py-16 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Legal notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Terms of use for the content and tools published on this website.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-muted">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Purpose</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This website is Josué's <strong class="text-text">personal portfolio</strong>. All of its content
          —write-ups, technical notes and tools— is published for
          <strong class="text-text">educational and research purposes</strong> in information security.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Authorized environments</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The techniques described were carried out in ethical-hacking labs and platforms (such as HackTheBox),
          in <strong class="text-text">controlled and authorized environments</strong>. No solutions to active
          machines, credentials or real data are published.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The content and tools are provided <strong class="text-text">“as is”</strong>, without warranty of any
          kind, express or implied, including their accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose or uninterrupted
          operation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Responsible use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Use the information and tools <strong class="text-text">only against systems you own or are explicitly
          authorized in writing to test</strong>. Using them is solely your responsibility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Disclaimer of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The author <strong class="text-text">accepts no liability</strong> for misuse or for any damage, direct
          or indirect, arising from the use of the information or tools published here. Unauthorized
          <strong class="text-text">access to computer systems</strong> you do not own is a crime in most
          jurisdictions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Intellectual property and license</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The website code and the tools are published under the <strong class="text-text">MIT license</strong>.
          Third-party trademarks, logos and names belong to their respective owners and are cited for
          identification purposes only.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions or takedown requests? Email me at <code class="font-mono text-sm text-text">{site.email}</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
